  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the set <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the largest element of set <math><mi>P</mi></math> is",
